
.TH M_shadow_value 3 "" "Odoc" "OCaml Library"
.SH Name
Oxcaml\.M_shadow_value
.SH Synopsis
.sp 
.in 2
\fBModule Oxcaml\.M_shadow_value\fR
.in 
.sp 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]kind_\fR value = value \f[CB]mod\fR portable
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR t_unannotated
.sp 
\f[CB]val\fR poly_unannotated : 'a\. \f[CB]'a\fR \f[CB]\->\fR \f[CB]'a\fR
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
The compiler implicitly adds the default kind value, but it should not be confused with the kind abbreviation above\.
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR t : value
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
value here is the abbreviation above, not the built-in default, so it is rendered and linked\.
.nf 

